msgstr "Ipadala agad"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:98
msgid ""
"Off: the campaign waits as a draft in listmonk, where you can edit it "
"visually before sending. It uses the template in the publishing admin's "
"language."
msgstr ""
"Naka-off: naghihintay ang campaign bilang draft sa listmonk, kung saan maaari"
" mo itong i-edit nang biswal bago ipadala. Ginagamit nito ang template sa "
"wika ng admin na nag-publish."

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:102
