#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:103
msgid "No other lists in listmonk yet."
msgstr "Wala pang ibang list sa listmonk."

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:104
msgid "People on several of these lists still get one email."
msgstr ""
"Isang email lang ang matatanggap ng mga taong nasa ilan sa mga list na ito."

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:111
msgid "Template data"
msgstr "Data ng template"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:113
msgid ""
"Town Hall fills these placeholders in the visual template with the event's "
"details. Keep them when you redesign it:"
msgstr ""
"Pinupunan ng Town Hall ang mga placeholder na ito sa visual na template gamit"
" ang detalye ng event. Panatilihin ang mga ito kapag binago mo ang disenyo:"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:115
msgid ""
"The sign-up button links to https://town-hall.invalid/event-link and the "
"event photo to https://town-hall.invalid/event-image.png; both are swapped "
"for the real ones."
msgstr ""
"Naka-link ang sign-up button sa https://town-hall.invalid/event-link at ang "
"larawan ng event sa https://town-hall.invalid/event-image.png; pareho itong "
"papalitan ng mga totoong link."

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:117
msgid ""
"Available in the template, next to the brand variables at its top ($org_name,"
" $color_primary, …):"
msgstr ""
"Available sa template, katabi ng mga brand variable sa itaas nito ($org_name,"
" $color_primary, …):"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:124
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Reset every language of “%(label)s” to the Town Hall default? Edits made in "
"listmonk will be lost."
msgstr ""
"I-reset ang bawat wika ng “%(label)s” sa default ng Town Hall? Mawawala ang "
"mga pagbabagong ginawa sa listmonk."

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:125
msgid "Reset to default"
msgstr "I-reset sa default"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:139
#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:130
msgid "listmonk"
msgstr "listmonk"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:141
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Nakakonekta"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:143
msgid "Users list"
msgstr "Listahan ng mga user"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:144
#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:139
msgid "Not created yet"
msgstr "Hindi pa nagagawa"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:148
msgid "Sync users now"
msgstr "I-sync ang mga user ngayon"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:155
msgid "Can't reach listmonk"
msgstr "Hindi maabot ang listmonk"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:157
msgid "Not connected: emails are printed in the server log."
msgstr "Hindi nakakonekta: ipi-print ang mga email sa log ng server."

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:162
#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:159
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Paano ito gumagana"

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:164
msgid ""
"Each email goes out in the language the person last used the site in, falling"
" back to the default language."
msgstr ""
"Ipinapadala ang bawat email sa wikang huling ginamit ng tao sa site, o sa "
"default na wika kung wala."

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:165
msgid ""
"Changing your name, logo or colours in Organization > Identity updates every "
"template automatically. Keep the brand variables at the top of each template."
msgstr ""
"Ang pagpapalit ng iyong pangalan, logo o kulay sa Organization > Identity ay "
"awtomatikong nag-a-update sa bawat template. Panatilihin ang mga brand "
"variable sa itaas ng bawat template."

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:166
msgid "Reset to default restores Town Hall's version of an event's templates."
msgstr ""
"Ibinabalik ng Reset to default ang bersyon ng Town Hall ng mga template ng "
"isang event."

#: console/templates/console/communication_email.html:167
msgid ""
"Everyone with an account is on the private “Town Hall users” list, with "
"attributes such as language, level and impact_points for segmenting "
"campaigns."
msgstr ""
"Nasa pribadong listahang “Town Hall users” ang lahat ng may account, na may "
"mga attribute tulad ng language, level at impact_points para sa pag-segment "
"ng mga campaign."

#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:24
msgid ""
"Choose which app events send a push notification. Volunteers turn "
"notifications on for each phone or computer when they're signed in, and can "
"install the site as an app."
msgstr ""
"Piliin kung aling mga event ng app ang magpapadala ng push notification. Ino-"
"on ng mga boluntaryo ang notification sa bawat phone o computer kapag naka-"
"sign in sila, at puwede nilang i-install ang site bilang app."

#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:43
msgid "Notification events"
msgstr "Mga event ng notification"

#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:55
#, python-format
msgid "Send “%(label)s” notifications"
msgstr "Ipadala ang mga notification na “%(label)s”"

#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:64
msgid "Custom notifications from listmonk"
msgstr "Mga custom na notification mula sa listmonk"

#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:65
#, python-format
msgid ""
"When someone turns notifications on, their devices are saved in their "
"listmonk subscriber attribute <code>%(attrib)s</code>. A plain-text campaign "
"sent with the Town Hall messenger reaches everyone on its lists who has "
"notifications on; the others are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Kapag may nag-on ng notification, sine-save ang kanilang mga device sa "
"kanilang listmonk subscriber attribute na <code>%(attrib)s</code>. Ang plain-"
"text na campaign na ipinadala gamit ang Town Hall messenger ay aabot sa lahat"
" ng nasa mga list nito na naka-on ang notification; nilalaktawan ang iba."

#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:67
msgid ""
"In listmonk, create a campaign and pick your lists, for example a "
"volunteering opportunities list."
msgstr ""
"Sa listmonk, gumawa ng campaign at piliin ang iyong mga list, halimbawa ang "
"isang list ng mga oportunidad sa pagboboluntaryo."

#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:68
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Set <strong>Messenger</strong> to <code>%(name)s</code>, "
"<strong>Format</strong> to Plain text, and <strong>Template</strong> to "
"“%(template_name)s”."
msgstr ""
"Itakda ang <strong>Messenger</strong> sa <code>%(name)s</code>, ang "
"<strong>Format</strong> sa Plain text, at ang <strong>Template</strong> sa "
"“%(template_name)s”."

#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:69
msgid ""
"The subject becomes the notification's title and the message its text. Keep "
"it short: phones show about two lines."
msgstr ""
"Ang subject ang magiging pamagat ng notification at ang mensahe ang magiging "
"teksto nito. Panatilihin itong maikli: mga dalawang linya lang ang "
"ipinapakita ng mga phone."

#: console/templates/console/communication_notifications.html:70
msgid ""
"To open a page when the notification is clicked, put its address on the last "
"line with <code>@TrackLink</code> right after it, e.g. "
"<code>https://example.org/en/opportunities/@TrackLink</code>. Without a link,"
" the home page opens. Either way listmonk counts the clicks, and shown "
"notifications count as views."
